{"3758400":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Coin Factory 2","steam_appid":3758400,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"Build a little factory. Make a lot of coins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/6945de93ccfc6aee2372fd9f8e93b898.poster.avif?t=1793655450\" aria-label=\"Build your factory. Twenty shop tiles arranged around a conveyor on a small grass island.\" width=992 height=576 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/6945de93ccfc6aee2372fd9f8e93b898.webm?t=1793655450\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/6945de93ccfc6aee2372fd9f8e93b898.mp4?t=1793655450\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Connect machines with conveyor belts, mix in support tiles, and spend your earnings on upgrades. Discover coin charms and new tile forms as your factory grows.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/4bf8c74f98397f5c849fa46aaf8837de.poster.avif?t=1793655450\" aria-label=\"Find your map. Riverlands, Ice and Meadow maps alongside three custom editor examples.\" width=992 height=624 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/4bf8c74f98397f5c849fa46aaf8837de.webm?t=1793655450\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/4bf8c74f98397f5c849fa46aaf8837de.mp4?t=1793655450\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Pick a map or make your own in the level editor. Optional Energy and Move modes change how you plan your factory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/294c47ea346feec213e7a2f2d9f6fb6f.poster.avif?t=1793655450\" aria-label=\"Steam Workshop. Animated rainbow Spectral Workshop belts carrying coins through a factory.\" width=992 height=576 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/294c47ea346feec213e7a2f2d9f6fb6f.webm?t=1793655450\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/294c47ea346feec213e7a2f2d9f6fb6f.mp4?t=1793655450\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Share maps, swap tile models, and try gameplay mods through Steam Workshop. A new island, a different set of rules, or just rainbow conveyor belts.<br>","about_the_game":"Build a little factory. Make a lot of coins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/6945de93ccfc6aee2372fd9f8e93b898.poster.avif?t=1793655450\" aria-label=\"Build your factory. Twenty shop tiles arranged around a conveyor on a small grass island.\" width=992 height=576 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/6945de93ccfc6aee2372fd9f8e93b898.webm?t=1793655450\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3758400\/extras\/6945de93ccfc6aee2372fd9f8e93b898.mp4?t=1793655450\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Connect machines with conveyor belts, mix in support tiles, and spend your earnings on upgrades. Discover coin charms and new tile forms as your factory grows.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli